request: Add a clear command that removes todos whose completed field is true. --single

single call 0: edit -> src/types.ts, src/commands.ts, src/commands.test.ts  (Add a `clear` command that removes completed todos. Todo has no `completed` field — completion is stored in `done` (set by `complete`), so `clear` filters out todos where `done` is true. Added: a `clear` Command variant, a pure `clear()` function, parseArgs support, and a run case that saves and reports "Cleared N". Existing tests are unchanged; only new tests are added.)
round 1: oracle GREEN
single call 1: accept  (Oracle is green; the clear command removes completed (done: true) todos and is covered by new tests.)

